  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Al-Shabaka: Palestinian Policy Analysis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&#x2019;s expected effect on society is to strengthen and centre Palestinian-led analysis in policy discourse. Some of the expected effects for the target group of the Project are to foster the capabilities of Palestinian policy analysts, widen the outreach of policy analysis, encourage analysts through fellowship program and centre Palestinian analysis within diplomatic circles and global policymaking.</narrative>
  </description>
